sers/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-11-25T17:12:12Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99683","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99683.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99683.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This reduces visual obstruction in the editor.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the cross' width no longer scales with zoom, improving visibility at high zoom levels.\r\n\r\nAlternative solution to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99628. This one is simpler - it avoids using an extra internal node which would have a performance cost in scenes with hundreds of TextureProgressBars or more[^1]. It also works more automatically by addressing the original problem at the core (bad visibility when editing pixel art UI), similar to how https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/75303 works.\r\n\r\n[^1]: Even if this is editor-only, it still has an impact when editing scenes in the editor.\r\n\r\nI also have an alternate version where the cross has a drop shadow (not included here), but given it's drawn with thin lines, it doesn't look great at high zoom levels since the lines start being separated from each other.\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n#### 100% zoom\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241125_180901](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a80e16f-3513-4949-9a8a-36573e710bb2)\r\n\r\n#### High zoom level (600% or so)\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_20241125_180906](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eda69769-7458-4059-9070-aa4123527f5b)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99683/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99683/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}